### Participant stats (admin) — status counts + gender and shirt size distribution
# shirtSizeDistribution keys are the sizes actually recorded (upper-cased);
# participants with no size are counted under `unspecified`.
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/stats?type=participant_stats
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### User stats (admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/stats?type=user_stats
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Wristband stats (admin) — by status, plus how many are linked to a participant
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/stats?type=wristband_stats
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Financial stats (admin) — revenue + payment counts by status
# Waived settlements (100% coupon) are completed payments of 0: they raise
# completedPayments without moving revenue.
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/stats?type=financial_stats
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Per-package report (admin) — participants and revenue per package
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports?reportType=package_performance
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
